  "description": "Introducing the All-New Juggernaut Hub Duo 2 – Affordable Power, Reimagined\nMeet the Juggernaut Hub Duo 2, the next-generation evolution of one of our most beloved eBikes. This upgraded model continues on with the performance of the original Juggernaut Hub Duo — without breaking the bank. Whether you're crushing commutes, hauling gear, or exploring backroads, the Juggernaut Hub Duo 2 delivers unbeatable performance for everyday riders and weekend warriors alike.\nKey Features of the Juggernaut Hub Duo 2:\n\n750W Geared Rear Hub Motor: Plenty of punch to flatten hills and power through tough terrain.\n\n80Nm Torque Output: Confidently climb moderate hills and haul heavy loads without breaking a sweat.\n\nMultiple Frame Options: Choose from Step-Over, Step-Thru or Small Step-Thru options to get the eBike that will fit you perfectly!\n\n52V 17.5Ah (910Wh) Internal Battery: Ride with confidence knowing you have plenty of power to spare for your adventures. Need more range? Add a secondary Range Extender to get up to double the range!\n\nOn-Demand Thumb Throttle: Cruise effortlessly when you need a break from pedaling.\n\nTorque + Cadence Pedal Assist Sensors: Smooth, responsive assistance that adapts to your riding style.\n\nWhy Choose the Hub Duo 2?\n\n✅ Tried and True Performance: A rider favourite refined motor with intuitive response, power and performance.\n\n✅ Effortless Power Delivery: Crush climbs and coast with confidence using 750W of reliable hub motor performance.\n\n✅ Urban & Off-Road Ready: Take on city streets, gravel paths, or weekend trails with ease.\n\n✅ Big Capacity, Built to Haul: Designed for riders who demand practical utility with no compromises.\n\n✅ Smarter Assist: The hybrid torque + cadence system delivers a natural pedalling feel that reacts instantly.\n\nThe Hub Duo 2 isn’t just an upgrade—it’s a whole new way to ride. Whether you’re a seasoned eBike enthusiast or upgrading from a basic commuter, this powerhouse gives you the freedom to go farther, carry more, and enjoy every mile.\n🔋 More power. More range. More adventure. Order the new Juggernaut Hub Duo 2 today and experience what next-level value truly feels like.",
